Appstore Description:

Fascinating game, TOP 1 Game in Russia!
More than 500,000 players all over the world!
Thanks to all players, stay with us!

iPad version: http://bit.ly/ec8OYq
****************************

"Paradise Island: Exotic" is the game for all sun and sea lovers! Tear yourself away from work and build your own sunny island! Is it time to make your own business? Just have some practice! Reach tourists are just about getting to your warm beaches! Entertain them in casinos and entertainment centers, restaurants and discos! Build your own empire of entertainment!

Game tasks:
- build all kinds of buildings on the Island;
- improve your buildings, repair them and gain profit;
- expand your property by buying new pieces of land and areas of sea;
- create your Island with unique buildings and plants;
- compete with your friends: be on top in different ratings;
- learn all tips of the game receive all possible rewards and win the Grand Prize!

Game features:
- beautiful and detailed graphics;
- extremely addictive and interesting gameplay;
- life on your island goes on even when the game is closed;
- there is a big choice of facilities and constructions, decorations and plants;
- playing the game, you'll have to struggle with friends for more than 130 of awards and achievements;
-compete with your friends for the first place in game ratings;
-play and get in touch with other players all over the world! Invıte your frıends from Facebook and Twıtter;
- Internet connection is recommended, but not necessary.

